"en41":ENL("en41","Future: going to",[["going to","ir a (futuro planeado)","🗓️"],["tomorrow","mañana","📆"],["next week","la próxima semana","➡️"],["next year","el próximo año","🎆"],["plan","plan","📝"],["vacation","vacaciones","🏖️"]],["Be going to","Planes: <b>I am going to visit my grandma.</b> <b>We are going to make our First Communion.</b> Pregunta: <b>Are you going to…?</b>",["am/is/are going to + verbo"],["She is going to study medicine.","We are going to pray the Rosary."]],[["What are you going to do on vacation?","¿Qué vas a hacer en vacaciones?"],["I'm going to visit the Basilica of Guadalupe.","Voy a visitar la Basílica de Guadalupe."],["That's wonderful!","¡Qué maravilla!"]],["God's plan","<b>«I know the plans I have for you», says the Lord</b> (Jer 29, 11).",{t:"emo",x:"🗺️ ✝️"}],[["«We are going to pray» significa…","Vamos a rezar","Rezamos","Rezamos ayer"],["Con «she» se usa…","is going to","are going to","am going to"]]),
